{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55657","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 五十五 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 五十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"退迹何人继昔贤，凡途终是事谋先。\n只知兢逐浮云富，谁解惊嗟逝水年。\n寒影半疎霜後树，秋声万点雨中禅。\n千般不更经营得，一榻无余任自然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55657.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55657","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}